# Unit29
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit29核心词汇

territory/ˈterətɔːri/领土/The country defended its territory.
threat/θret/威胁/Pollution is a threat to public health.
thrive/θraɪv/繁荣/The business has thrived recently.
tolerate/ˈtɑːləreɪt/容忍/I can't tolerate such behavior.
torture/ˈtɔːrtʃər/折磨/He was tortured for information.
tough/tʌf/艰难的/It was a tough decision.
trace/treɪs/追踪/The police traced the call.
tradition/trəˈdɪʃn/传统/It is a tradition to eat dumplings.
tragic/ˈtrædʒɪk/悲剧的/The accident had tragic consequences.
trait/treɪt/特征/Honesty is an admirable trait.
transaction/trænˈzækʃn/交易/The bank handles transactions daily.
transform/trænsˈfɔːrm/转变/Technology has transformed our lives.
transmit/trænzˈmɪt/传输/The disease is transmitted through water.
transparent/trænsˈpærənt/透明的/The government should be transparent.
transport/ˈtrænspɔːrt/运输/Public transport is convenient.
trap/træp/陷阱/The fox was caught in a trap.
tremendous/trɪˈmendəs/巨大的/She made a tremendous effort.
trend/trend/趋势/There is a growing trend toward online shopping.
trial/ˈtraɪəl/审判；试验/The trial lasted three weeks.
trigger/ˈtrɪɡər/引发/The crisis triggered protests.
triumph/ˈtraɪʌmf/胜利/Her victory was a triumph of determination.
tropical/ˈtrɑːpɪkl/热带的/The island has a tropical climate.
ultimate/ˈʌltɪmət/最终的/This is the ultimate goal.
undergo/ˌʌndərˈɡoʊ/经历/The country is undergoing changes.
underlie/ˌʌndərˈlaɪ/构成…的基础/Several factors underlie this problem.
undertake/ˌʌndərˈteɪk/承担/She undertook the task with enthusiasm.
unemployment/ˌʌnɪmˈplɔɪmənt/失业/Unemployment has risen sharply.
uniform/ˈjuːnɪfɔːrm/制服；一致的/The students wear uniforms.
unique/juˈniːk/独特的/Each person has a unique fingerprint.
universal/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːrsl/普遍的/Healthcare should be universal.
update/ʌpˈdeɪt/更新/Please update your information.
upgrade/ʌpˈɡreɪd/升级/They upgraded the system.
uphold/ʌpˈhoʊld/维护/The court upheld the verdict.
urban/ˈɜːrbən/城市的/Urban areas have more opportunities.
urge/ɜːrdʒ/催促/She urged him to see a doctor.
utilize/ˈjuːtəlaɪz/利用/We should utilize all resources.
valid/ˈvælɪd/有效的/Your passport is no longer valid.
vanish/ˈvænɪʃ/消失/The magician made the rabbit vanish.
vary/ˈveri/变化/Prices vary from store to store.
vast/væst/广阔的/The vast desert stretches for miles.
venture/ˈventʃər/风险投资/He started a new venture.
verify/ˈverɪfaɪ/验证/Please verify the information.
version/ˈvɜːrʒn/版本/This is the latest version.
victim/ˈvɪktɪm/受害者/The victims received aid.
violate/ˈvaɪəleɪt/违反/He violated the contract.
violence/ˈvaɪələns/暴力/The government condemned the violence.
virtual/ˈvɜːrtʃuəl/虚拟的/She attended a virtual meeting.
visible/ˈvɪzəbl/看得见的/The mountain is visible from here.
vital/ˈvaɪtl/至关重要的/Water is vital for survival.
vivid/ˈvɪvɪd/生动的/She gave a vivid description.
